ERROR at line 3: String does not support indexing with []
  s[i] would hide an O(n) scan — Strings are UTF-8 encoded and characters
  are variable-width.
  help: use s.char_at(i) for the i-th character (O(n)) — it returns Option[char], so match it or unwrap it,
        or s.bytes()[i] for raw byte access (O(1))
